  "question": {
    "text": "The edge of an aluminium cube is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> long. One face of the cube is firmly fixed to a vertical wall. A mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> is then attached to the opposite face of the cube. The shear modulus of aluminium is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>GPa</mi></math>. What is the vertical deflection of this face?",
